==Korean==

===Etymology===
From [[이]] {{qualifier|i}}, "this" + [[것]] {{qualifier|geot}}, "thing"

===Pronoun===
{{ko-pos|pronoun|hidx=ㅇ}} {{qualifier|demonstrative}}

# [[this]]

====Usage notes====
이것 {{qualifier|igeot}} can contract to [[이거]] {{qualifier|igeo}}. Thus, 이것[[은]] can contract to [[이건]], 이것[[이]] to [[이게]], 이것[[을]] to [[이걸]], and 이것[[으로]] to [[이걸로]].

